    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15469" root="رسغ" body-key="r">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَسَغَهُ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَسَغَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَسْغٌ</span>, [<i>He tethered him
by the fore legs;</i> i. e.] <i>he tied the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُسْغ</span> [or <i>pastern</i>]
<i>of each of his</i> (a camel's [or an ass's]) <i>fore legs
with a string,</i> or <i>cord,</i> which is called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُسْغٌ</span>. (TA.)

